+## Arm AppReady Status
+- **Target profile**: ARM64-native. There are no x64 binary dependencies and no kernel code.
+- **AppReady stages reached**:
+  - Assess: done
+  - Build: done
+  - Deploy: not applicable (library)
+  - Optimize: skipped (WOS_SKIP_OPTIMIZE)
+- **Dependencies**: none at runtime. The MSVC toolset and Windows SDK are native on ARM64. MSYS2 bash/make (x64, emulated) is only used to drive the build.
+- **Blockers requiring App Assure**: none.
